# ── Root .dockerignore ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Prevents sending unnecessary files to the Docker build context.
# Both Dockerfiles use the repo root as context.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.vercel
**/venv
**/.venv
**/.env
**/.env.*
# Keep the local-dev template available (was `!.env.local.example`, which only
# matched the repo root — scope repo-wide so nested templates stay visible).
!**/.env.local.example
# Secrets that must never enter the build context.
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.aws/**
.git
.gitignore
.github/
scripts/
supabase/
apps/
packages/
fivem-resources/
*.md
docs/
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.vercel/
